---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeaderV2 from '../../components/HeaderV2.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'June 6, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Qbits Energy"
  description="The terms and conditions governing your use of qbitsenergy.com and the services and information provided by Qbits Energy."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <HeaderV2 />

  <main id="main-content" class="pt-[104px] lg:pt-[120px]">
    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-main max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of
          <a href="https://qbitsenergy.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">qbitsenergy.com</a>
          (the "Site") and the information, content, and services offered through it. By accessing the Site, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Site.
        </p>

        <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. About us</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              The Site is operated by Qbits Energy ("Qbits", "we", "us"), a subsidiary of Heaven Green Energy Limited, with registered address at 201, Anupam Square, Mahadev Chowk, Mota Varachha, Surat, Gujarat 394101, India.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. Use of the site</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
              <li>The Site is provided for informational and commercial inquiry purposes related to Qbits solar inverters and associated services.</li>
              <li>You agree not to use the Site for any unlawful purpose, to infringe intellectual property, to transmit malware, or to interfere with normal operation.</li>
              <li>You must not scrape, reverse-engineer, or systematically extract content from the Site without our prior written consent.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. Product information</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Product specifications, prices, certification statuses, warranty terms, and availability are subject to change without notice. Where a discrepancy exists between the Site and the actual product datasheet or sales contract, the datasheet or contract prevails. All product images are illustrative.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Warranty</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Warranty terms for Qbits products are described in the printed warranty card supplied with each unit and in our published warranty policy. Marketing copy on the Site (including phrases such as "8 + 4 year warranty") summarizes those terms; the printed warranty card is the binding document.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Service and installation</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Installation, commissioning, and routine service are performed by Authorized Service Partners listed on
              <a href="/authorized-service-partners/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">our partner directory</a>. Qbits is not responsible for installation work performed by unauthorized installers.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">6. User submissions</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Any data you submit through forms on the Site (contact, dealer inquiries, partner applications) must be accurate and lawful. You grant Qbits a non-exclusive license to use submitted information for the purpose of responding to your inquiry and providing requested services.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">7. Intellectual property</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              All content on the Site - text, images, graphics, logos, code, blog posts - is the property of Qbits or its licensors and is protected by Indian and international copyright and trademark law. You may share short excerpts with attribution; bulk reproduction requires written permission.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">8. Third-party links</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              The Site links to third-party resources (e.g., government schemes, partner websites, app stores). We do not control and are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of those resources.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">9. Disclaimer</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              The Site and its content are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranty of any kind, express or implied. Information about subsidy schemes, tax incentives, and regulatory requirements is general; verify current details with the relevant government authority before relying on it.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">10. Limitation of liability</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              To the maximum extent permitted by law, Qbits shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits or revenues, arising from your use of, or inability to use, the Site.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">11. Governing law and jurisdiction</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Surat, Gujarat.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">12. Changes to these Terms</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              We may revise these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">13. Contact</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Questions about these Terms? Email <a href="mailto:service@qbitsenergy.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">service@qbitsenergy.com</a>.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
